    dialoguesFinalDays: []
  quarantineExitLines:
  - Corner pocket. Fine. I've bluffed out of worse hands.
  - Two-to-one I'm out by morning. I like those odds.
  killExitLines:
  - "Funny\u2026 three aces\u2026 and still not enough\u2026"
  - "House always wins\u2026 should have\u2026 bet on that\u2026"
